{"ref":"BDB, חֹרוֹנַיִם","hw":"חֹרוֹנַיִם","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">חֹרוֹנַיִם</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">חֹרֹנַיִם</span></big>  <strong>n.pr.loc. (</strong>poss. <em>two hollows, caves, ravines</em>, v. <a data-ref=\"BDB, בֵּית חוֹרֹן\" href=\"/BDB,_בֵּית חוֹרֹן\", dir=\"rtl\">בֵּית חוֹרֹן</a><strong>)</strong>—<span dir=\"rtl\">דֶּרֶךְ חרונים</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 15:5\" href=\"/Isaiah.15.5\">Is 15:5</a> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 48:3\" href=\"/Jeremiah.48.3\">Je 48:3</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">מוֹרַד חֹרוֹנָ֑יִם</span> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 48:5\" href=\"/Jeremiah.48.5\">Je 48:5</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">חֹרֹנַיִם</span> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 48:34\" href=\"/Jeremiah.48.34\">48:34</a>, city of Moab; = MI<sup>31.32</sup> <span dir=\"rtl\">חורנן</span> (i.e. prob. <span dir=\"rtl\">הוֹרֹנֵן</span>); 𝔊 Αρωνιειμ, Ωρωναιμ.—On <span dir=\"rtl\">חֹרֹנַיִם</span> 𝔊 <a data-ref=\"Joshua 13:10\" href=\"/Joshua.13.10\">Jos 13:10</a>, <a data-ref=\"Joshua 13:11\" href=\"/Joshua.13.11\">11</a> <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 13:34\" href=\"/II_Samuel.13.34\">2 S 13:34</a> v. We Dr and <a data-ref=\"BDB, בֵּית חוֹרֹן\" href=\"/BDB,_בֵּית חוֹרֹן\", dir=\"rtl\">בֵּית חוֹרֹן</a>.","next":"BDB, חַרְנֶ֫פֶר","prev":"BDB, חֹרֹנִי"}